  "description": "Han Yiman loves peaches so much that even his parents have grown tired of it. After being told that he should get the peaches he wants to eat on his own, he begins taking seasonal jobs at peach farms whenever peach season arrives. One day, he sees Baek Sua on a peach farm’s promotional page. Struck by how much she resembles a peach, he becomes attracted to her and ends up working at the farm run by her father... He finally gets the chance to meet the beautiful and naturally innocent Baek Sua in person, but he is unable to speak with her. Disappointed, Han Yiman spends the entire night staring at peaches. Eventually, one of them reminds him of Baek Sua, and he begins masturbating while thinking about her—only to be caught in the act by Baek Sua, who had come to bring him a late-night snack...\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/utopia)",
